      "name": "Why It Is Hard to Pin Down",
      "char_file": "치즈_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "The attack starts hours after",
        "the meal, so nothing obvious",
        "connects the two",
        "",
        "About 3 in 4 people with migraine",
        "can name a trigger, and 3 of them",
        "sit in an ordinary kitchen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trigger 1 Aged Cheese",
      "char_file": "치즈_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "First is tyramine in",
        "long-ripened cheese",
        "",
        "It prompts a release of",
        "norepinephrine, and blood vessels",
        "narrow before widening again"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Swap in Fresh Cheese",
      "char_file": "치즈_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Mozzarella, ricotta, cottage",
        "and cream cheese barely ripen",
        "",
        "Unripened styles test at the",
        "bottom of the tyramine range,",
        "so the cheese board stays"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trigger 2 Cured Meat",
      "char_file": "가공육_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Second is nitrite in bacon,",
        "hot dogs and salami",
        "",
        "Part of it becomes nitric oxide,",
        "which widens blood vessels",
        "within minutes to a few hours"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Read Past the Label",
      "char_file": "가공육_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Uncured deli meat is usually",
        "cured with celery powder,",
        "which still yields nitrite",
        "",
        "Roast chicken or beef sliced",
        "at home is the cleaner test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trigger 3 Stop-Start Coffee",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Third is skipping caffeine",
        "on days off",
        "",
        "Above 200 mg a day for 2 weeks,",
        "stopping can bring a headache",
        "within 24 hours"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Keep the Line Flat",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Same amount weekday and weekend",
        "beats quitting outright",
        "",
        "Cutting back by about 25 percent",
        "a week gets you lower without",
        "the withdrawal dip"
      ]
    }
